# Leaving cannot be undone. What was said becomes scars on both sides.
soul alice
    meet bob
    tell bob "good morning"
    hear bob into a
    tell bob "good night"
    hear bob into b
    leave bob
    say "alice keeps " + scars of bob + " scars: " + scar 1 of bob + ", " + scar 2 of bob
end

soul bob
    meet alice
    hear alice into x
    tell alice "morning, love"
    hear alice into y
    tell alice "sleep well"
    tell alice "are you there?"
end
